<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Bizzlo Partner Operating Playbook</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Bizzlo Partner Operating Playbook</h1>
  <h2>Daily manager and counselor workflow</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Create partner manager and counselor logins from Team & Partners.</li>
    <li>Create student files with mandatory profile, intake, destination, and discipline fields.</li>
    <li>Use Program Search to shortlist partner-linked university options.</li>
    <li>Collect Passport, Academic Transcript, Degree Certificate, IELTS/PTE, SOP, LOR, CV, and Bank Statement.</li>
    <li>Submit applications to Videshway admin after document quality checks.</li>
    <li>Track offer received, deposit paid, CAS/I-20/COE, visa filed, visa granted, and enrolled stages.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Manager checks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Review counselor seat usage before creating new counselor accounts.</li>
    <li>Keep GST, PAN, bank, billing address, and payout currency updated in Finance.</li>
    <li>Use 360 Solutions for SOP, visa, loan, forex, accommodation, and arrival support requests.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Admin checks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Approve documents only after quality and scan status review.</li>
    <li>Move applications through university and visa workflow stages.</li>
    <li>Monitor partner application counts, finance profile status, and commission payment stages.</li>
  </ul>
</body>
</html>
